       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRNLIM01.

       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUTHREQ.
       COPY LIMITCTX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT.
           INITIALIZE LIMIT-CONTEXT

           CALL 'LIMITPOL' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           CALL 'EXCEPT01' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           CALL 'TMPCTRL' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           CALL 'MERCHVAL' USING AUTH-REQUEST LC-MCC-LIMIT
           CALL 'CUSTRSK' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT

           IF LC-RISK-AVAILABLE NOT = 'Y'
              CALL 'RISKFBK' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           END-IF

           CALL 'LIMUTIL' USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT
           GOBACK.
